  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f69c6b1f1e1fc2c4b9a85c7696ada520, type: 3}
  m_Name: AfterStreet2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSO
  replics:
  - Eve! Perfect timing. Settle this argument for us.
  - "I\u2019m listening carefully, Mister\u2026 Mister. "
  - Beast wants to return to Spain with Ferret after paying off his debt. Personally,
    I think non-corporate countries are doomed to poverty. Especially Spain.
  - "And what exactly is the argument about? You want Miss\u2014 "
  - MRS.
  - "Mrs\u2026 uh\u2026 which one of those four words is even your surname? Whatever.
    So you want Mrs. Ferret and Beast to stay in America?"
  - "The point is that your brother is acting childish. Once this is all over, he
    wants to stay here. Which means cutting off all his ties, including you. Then
    he\u2019ll grow up and regret ending up completely alone. I think he\u2019ll
    regret it. "
  - "Regret what? It\u2019s not like he has friends here. Let him stay. Let him keep
    believing that countries where there\u2019s still room for actual HUMAN beings
    are doomed to become poor."
  - "At least people there get to breathe clean air for a few years. Honestly, I
    don\u2019t care anymore what you want or think, Cyber. "
  - "If you enjoy being a doormat for society\u2019s \u201Celite,\u201D stay here.
    Meanwhile idiots like me \u2014 and Beast too \u2014 will keep dreaming about
    moving to some \u201Cpoor\u201D little village, milking goats because apparently
    there are no other jobs there, eating real food and touching grass\u2026"
  - "You two again\u2026?"
  - "\u201CYou two\u201D? Who are you talking about? I stopped listening because
    I don\u2019t understand why this PEASANT girl is telling me about her life plans.
    I thought even uneducated villagers knew the ELITE don\u2019t talk to them."
  - "Oh really? Then why did you even join the conversation? Especially with Beast?
    We\u2019re mentally \u201Cpeasants\u201D too, aren\u2019t we? Why don\u2019t
    you talk to Ferret instead? She\u2019s tall, beautiful, blue-eyed. Obvious elite
    material."
  - "What exactly does my wife have to do with Cyber\u2019s opinion? "
  - "I think Eve\u2019s upset because her mother never loved her, and even after
    growing up she still doesn\u2019t get attention from people around her. "
  - "I don\u2019t remember insulting anyone. I actually complimented Ferret, who\u2019s
    probably listening to us right now too. And honestly? Ferret wants money, Cyber
    wants money, both are childish and sensitive."
  - "Let them stay together in America and destroy each other\u2019s nerves since
    neither of them knows how to communicate."
  - "Meanwhile me, Mister Beast, Asahi\u2026 basically the people in this team with
    functioning brains will live just fine. The others can stay here for all I care. "
  - Did Beast remind you of your father because of the Latin roots?
  - "\u2026."
  - NO. Bye.
  - And why would you say that to her?
  - "Wasn\u2019t she the one insulting everyone just now? Especially your wife."
  - "Still. Why? You\u2019re constantly rude to her, yet she keeps trying to stay
    close to you. She insults you and still worries about you anyway."
  - "Are you a psychopath or something? I honestly don\u2019t even know what to tell
    you. "
  - Want a drink maybe?
  - "I\u2019m not exactly following the logic of your words\u2026 "
